 scripts/sync-agent-palette-tokens.mjs --check.
+
+ppclip editors can retain a dedicated portrait-framed canvas and pause it in the existing front-facing rest sample. Definition updates redraw synchronously while paused, so center and angle dragging does not load intermediate SVG images. The page header keeps page-scoped input while the editor uses region-scoped input; offscreen and reduced-motion scheduling remain suspended.
+
+Live performance: runtime canvases use native device pixel ratio capped at 2; face textures scale to display size (256–1024). Paused input is detached, repeated playback/pose setters are no-ops, and leaving the editor clears its rotation override. Static snapshot geometry and rendering are unchanged.
